      bOrigTitle: 'Original designs', bOrigHelp: 'The game’s 21 designs, read from your disc (nothing is stored on the site). Click one to start from it, then touch it up. Each style has 6 designs, shared by its TYPE-1, 2 and 3, plus the one of its SPECIAL board. The memory card keeps 32 colours: the design is slightly simplified when saved.',
      bOrigN: (n) => 'Design ' + n, bOrigSp: 'SPECIAL', bOrigLoaded: (s) => 'Original design loaded: ' + s + '. Pick the type, touch it up, then write it to the card.',
